{"id":"n47976-1-6","stage":0,"title":"최고 · 最","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47976-1-6-1","ko":"살이 많이 쪄서 걱정이에요.","zh":"我胖了很多，好担心啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"살이","meaning":"皮肤","explanation":"살：皮肤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"4","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쪄서","meaning":"发胖，长膘","explanation":"찌다：发胖，长膘；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걱정이에요.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"皮肤","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的外皮表面。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"发胖，长膘","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"62375","definition":"身上长肉变胖。","pronunciation":["찌다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a80420dc460bba87dea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47976-1-6-2","ko":"살을 빼는 데에는 운동이 최고죠.","zh":"想要减肥的话，运动才是最好的方法啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"살을","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빼는","meaning":"减肥，减重","explanation":"빼다：减肥，减重；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"9","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데에는","meaning":"处所，地方。","explanation":"데：处所，地方。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동이","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"최고죠.","meaning":"最；最佳","explanation":"최고：最；最佳；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的身体中包裹着骨头的柔软部分。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"减肥，减重","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"使肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"97b8be84b3d009c4","term":"최고","zh":"最；最佳","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3","entryId":"47976","definition":"最好或最出色的。","pronunciation":["최ː고","췌ː고"]}],"audio":"/audio/e0cf7ec3ea880581ce08.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=47976","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2399,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我胖了很多，好担心啊。","想要减肥的话，运动才是最好的方法啊。","周末有什么打算吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我胖了很多，好担心啊。","想要减肥的话，运动才是最好的方法啊。","周末有什么打算吗？"],"answer":1}]}
